      <Output>
        <ErrorInfo>
          <Message>US1 T021/T022 complete (legacy ThemeManager facade deleted), but the scanner regex still catches only the "#RRGGBB" quoted-string form — Color.FromRgb(0xRR,...) literals across ~14 files remain. Enable this test once the scanner is broadened and those call-sites have moved to ThemeTokens. Until then use NoHardcodedChromeHex_Diagnostic.</Message>
        </ErrorInfo>
      </Output>
